Package: openmediavault-rustfs
Architecture: any
Depends: openmediavault (>= 8.0)
Priority: optional
Description: openmediavault RustFS plugin
 Manage the RustFS S3 compatible object storage server from the
 OpenMediaVault web interface. The upstream rustfs binary is bundled in
 this package and runs as a native systemd service; the settings (data
 shared folder, API and console ports, credentials, log level) are
 stored in the OMV configuration database and rendered to
 /etc/default/rustfs and the systemd unit on Apply.
 Includes a generated data directory with an enable guard, automatically
 generated access and secret keys with a rotation button, start, stop,
 restart, a log viewer, the generated configuration preview and Chinese
 translations.
